In short: both tracks are source-available, dual-licensed under PolyForm
Strict 1.0.0 (noncommercial use, research, evaluation, and personal study,
indefinitely) or PolyForm Free Trial 1.0.0 (evaluate the software for your
business for less than 32 consecutive calendar days). Production or any
other commercial use beyond the trial window requires a commercial license
from Onibex, LLC. See COMMERCIAL-LICENSE.md or contact https://onibex.com.
Each directory is licensed individually, so the tracks can evolve
independently.

SPDX (for SBOMs):
LicenseRef-PolyForm-Strict-1.0.0 OR LicenseRef-PolyForm-Free-Trial-1.0.0

This file is plain text on purpose, and carries no Markdown. It is named
LICENSE with no extension because that is the name a license scanner and a
procurement review look for, and because the header stamped on every source
file points here by that name. Anything written here has to read correctly
unrendered, so the map above is a list rather than a table.


